{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-pom-portable-battery-and-magnetic-wireless-charger-sold-by-tk-maxx-2511-0112","content_id":"1d46a003-2005-43c8-a8f8-c9dd7bdd71fb","description":"Product Recall for POM Portable Battery and Magnetic Wireless Charger presenting a high risk of fire.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"dc3b32b3-1e3b-4465-8b93-040091367541","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-03-18T10:37:17+00:00","id":"dc3b32b3-1e3b-4465-8b93-040091367541","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-03-18T10:37:17+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69ba805def857f1696d12597/2511-0112-product-recall-POM-battery-pack-and-charger.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: POM Portable Battery and Magnetic Wireless Charger sold by TK Maxx</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a risk of fire as it can overheat during use.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by TK Maxx.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Electrical appliances and equipment - Chargers</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>POM</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Models</td>\n      <td>P2G-Q28-WT</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Receipt and Price Ticket Codes</td>\n      <td>000869, 008485, 018281, 584943</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Sales Period</td>\n      <td>July 2025-January 2026</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>White and black portable power bank.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_dc3b32b3-1e3b-4465-8b93-040091367541\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69ba805def857f1696d12597/2511-0112-product-recall-POM-battery-pack-and-charger.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a risk of fire as the internal wiring is not securely attached. This could lead to wires loosening during use. Loose wiring may cause the product to short-circuit, overheat and catch fire.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users by TJX UK (TK Maxx).\nOwners are advised to stop using the product immediately and return it to your nearest TK Maxx or Homesense store for a refund or replacement.</p>\n\n<p>For more information, please see: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://www.tkmaxx.com/uk/en/l/product-recall\">https://www.tkmaxx.com/uk/en/l/product-recall</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2511-0112</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-18T10:37:57Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"electrical-appliances-equipment","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-03-18","product_risk_level":"high"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-03-18T10:37:58+00:00","links":{"available_tra